  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia"><head>ΣΘΕΝΕΒΟΙΑ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-stheneboia-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.nauck1889grc1:661">
            <note type="source">1. Aristoph. Ran. 1250 sq. (1217 sq.)</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐκ ἔστιν ὅστις πάντ᾽ ἀνὴρ εὐδαιμονεῖ·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἢ γὰρ πεφυκὼς ἐσθλὸς οὐκ ἔχει βίον,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ἢ δυσγενὴς ὢν</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ubi Schol. τὸ λοιπὸν τοῦ ἰάμβου</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">πλουσίαν ἀροῖ πλάκα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-stheneboia-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.nauck1889grc1:662">
            <note type="source">2. Stobaeus LXVIII, 15.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πολλοὺς δὲ πλούτῳ καὶ γένει γαυρουμένους</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">γυνὴ κατήσχυν᾽ ἐν δόμοισι νηπία.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-stheneboia-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.nauck1889grc1:668">
            <note type="source">3. Stobaeus XXIX, 36. Apostol. III, 42. Arsen. Viol. p. 62 ed. Walz. sine nom. fab.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἄνευ τύχης γὰρ, ὥσπερ ἡ παροιμία,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">πόνος μονωθεὶς οὐκέτ᾽ ἀλγύνει βροτούς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-stheneboia-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.stheneboia.nauck1889grc1:664">
            <note type="source">4. Athen. X, p. 427 E. τοῖς δὲ τετελευτηκόσι τῶν φίλων ἀπένεμον τὰ πίπτοντα τῆς τροφῆς ἀπὸ τῶν τραπεζών. διὸ καὶ Εὐριπίδης περὶ τῆς Σθενεβοίας φησὶν, ἐπειδὴ νομίζει τὸν Βελλεροφόντην τεθνάναι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πεσὸν δέ νιν λέληθεν οὐδὲν ἐκ χερός·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ εὐθὺς αὐδᾷ· τῷ Κορινθίῳ ξένῳ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-stheneboia-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_stheneboia">
            <note type="source">5. Schol. Ven. Aristoph. Pac. 124. ὁ λόγος ἐκ Σθενεβοίας Εὐριπίδου. τινὲς δὲ οἴονται ἐκ</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
